  ## The runtime-visible package is constructor-correlated with the exact
  ## erased trace in its index. Recursive constructors retain the canonical
  ## child-origin cursor package and suffix package directly, so consumers can
  ## recurse without reopening erased evidence or rebuilding runtime data.
